---
title: Welcome to Elderpickle
description: First notes on the Elderpickle site — Astro, Tailwind, and a dark navy theme.
pubDate: 2026-09-01
---

Elderpickle ships as a static Astro site with Tailwind v4 and shadcn/ui React islands.

## Why this stack

Astro keeps most of the page as HTML. React hydrates only where interaction is needed, like the mobile menu.

## What is next

Add your own posts under `src/content/blog`, drop an encoded hero MP4 into `public/video/`, and set `SITE` when you build for Cloud Run.
